+            (pos.sha256_hex.as_str(), pos.created_at_key.as_str()),
+            (second.as_str(), ""),
+            "only once the first candidate has actually walked every fetched row does \
+             the ladder advance, and then to the front of the next candidate"
+        );
+    }
